GENERATING NEW TEST
	To add new test, run "add_new_test_file.py" with two parameters:
		- tested file path (path must be relative to your current working dir)
		- tested function name
	Generated file name may be changed without any consequences.

	Good practise is to use "add_new_test_file.py" script from test directory (not framework),
	because it prepend appropriate license header.

	Afterwards, add the folder into tests/unit/framework/tests_config.py DIRECTORIES_WITH_TESTS_LIST

BUILDING TESTS
	Run tests/unit/framework/run_unit_tests.py.

	Logs of build and run are stored under tests/unit/framework/logs for debugging

RUNNING SINGLE TEST
	Executable tests files are stored by default in 'tests/unit/tests/build/sources_to_test_repository/'

REQUIREMENTS FOR BUILD:
- cmocka
- cmake
- ctags (Exuberant version)
- nm, gcc, make
